@decision public-core-1-0-0
  meaning
    says "inventarch 1.0.0: the public reset changes the licence, the repository, the kit set (private kits removed, two authoring kit ids retired), the release format and the hooks' behaviour, so it is a breaking release under a fresh history."
  work
